{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/gsap/tween_stagger_timeline/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"tween\" style=\"position:relative;\">tween<a href=\"#tween\" aria-label=\"tween permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>Tweens는 모든 애니메이션이 작동하는 역할을 말하며, ( high-performance property setter ) 대상 ( 애니메이션을 적용할 객체) 에게 duration, animation-properties 정보를 입력하는 하나의 단위로 해석합니다.</p>\n<p>Tween은 3가지의 methods를 가지고 애니메이션을 만들 수 있으며 각각의 트윈엔 기본 규칙으로 <code class=\"language-text\">target</code>과 <code class=\"language-text\">vars object</code> 옵션을 가집니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-기본-문법---to-from-fromto\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 기본 문법 - to, from, fromTo<a href=\"#1-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95---to-from-fromto\" aria-label=\"1 기본 문법   to from fromto permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"gsapto\" style=\"position:relative;\">gsap.to()<a href=\"#gsapto\" aria-label=\"gsapto permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.elem'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">rotation</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">45</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"gsapfrom\" style=\"position:relative;\">gsap.from()<a href=\"#gsapfrom\" aria-label=\"gsapfrom permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'.elem'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">rotation</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">45</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"gsapfromto\" style=\"position:relative;\">gsap.fromTo()<a href=\"#gsapfromto\" aria-label=\"gsapfromto permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">fromTo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token string\">'.elem'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">rotation</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">45</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">rotation</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">45</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - Basic Tween\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/yLrMBPw?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/yLrMBPw\">\r\n  GSAP3 - Basic Tween</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<p>재생속도를 정하지 않았다면 gsap은 기본값인 0.5s(500ms)를 사용합니다.</p>\n<h4 id=\"1-1-short-codes-properties\" style=\"position:relative;\">1-1. Short codes properties<a href=\"#1-1-short-codes-properties\" aria-label=\"1 1 short codes properties permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>x: 100</strong>: transform: translateX(100px)</li>\n<li><strong>y: 100</strong>: trasnform: translateY(100px)</li>\n<li><strong>rotation: 360</strong>: transform: rotate(360deg)</li>\n<li><strong>rotationX: 360</strong>: transform: rotateX(360deg)</li>\n<li><strong>rotationY: 360</strong>: transform: rotateY(360deg)</li>\n<li><strong>skewX: 45</strong>: transform: skewX(45deg)</li>\n<li><strong>skewY: 45</strong>: transform: skewY(45deg)</li>\n<li><strong>scale: 2</strong>: transform: scale(2, 2)</li>\n<li><strong>scaleX: 2</strong>: transform: scaleX(2)</li>\n<li><strong>scaleY: 2</strong>: transform: scaleY(2)</li>\n<li><strong>xPercent: -50  /  x: “-50%”</strong>: transform: translateX(-50%)</li>\n<li><strong>yPercent: -50  /  y: “-50%”</strong>: transform: translateY(-50%)</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p><strong>브라우저 성능을 고려한다면</strong><br>\n브라우저 성능을 최대치로 끌어올리기 위해선 <code class=\"language-text\">CSS Transform</code>과 <code class=\"language-text\">Opacity</code>의 애니메이션을 사용해야 한다. <code class=\"language-text\">CSS Transform</code>과 <code class=\"language-text\">Opacity</code>가 아닌 값을 변경하면 브라우저가 페이지 레이아웃을 다시 랜더링(re-rander)하여 트윈이 많을 경우 성능을 저하시킬 수 있다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"2-지연과-반복---delay-repeat-yoyo-repeatdelay\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 지연과 반복 - delay, repeat, yoyo, repeatDelay<a href=\"#2-%EC%A7%80%EC%97%B0%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B0%98%EB%B3%B5---delay-repeat-yoyo-repeatdelay\" aria-label=\"2 지연과 반복   delay repeat yoyo repeatdelay permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>스페셜 속성은 애니메이션이 실행되는 방식과 수행해야 하는 작업을 정의합니다.<br>\n특수 속성은 애니메이션 되지 않습니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>delay</strong> : 애니메이션이 시작되기 전에 지연시간을 지정합니다.</li>\n<li><strong>repeat</strong> : 애니메이션이 몇번 반복되어야 하는지를 지정합니다.</li>\n<li><strong>yoyo</strong> : <code class=\"language-text\">true</code> 로 설정하면 애니메이션이 앞뒤로 재생됩니다.</li>\n<li><strong>repeatDelay</strong> : 각 반복 사이에 발생하는 지연시간을 지정합니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-info\">\n<p>무한 반복은 <code class=\"language-text\">repeat: -1</code> 을 설정하면 애니메이션이 무기한 반복됩니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-info\">\n<p>yoyo 속성은 <code class=\"language-text\">repeat</code> 설정이 들어있어야 사용가능합니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - Basic Tween\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/oNOZvpz?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/oNOZvpz\">\r\n  GSAP3 - Basic Tween</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"3-가속도---easing\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 가속도 - easing<a href=\"#3-%EA%B0%80%EC%86%8D%EB%8F%84---easing\" aria-label=\"3 가속도   easing permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>ease는 애니메이션이 재생될 때의 변경 속도를 제어합니다.<br>\n간단한 사용에서 ease는 애니메이션이 느려지거나 빨라지는지에 대한 여부를 제어합니다.</p>\n<p>가속도 제어는 ease를 기본값(default)로 가지며, 커브가 가파를수록 더 급격한 변화를 만들 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p>“power.out”, “sine.in”, “sine.out” 등의 값을 많이 사용합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\".elem\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">duration</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">2.5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">ease</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"power1.out\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">500</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://gsap.com/docs/v3/Eases/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://gsap.com/docs/v3/Eases/</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"4-다중-요소-제어---stagger\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. 다중 요소 제어 - stagger<a href=\"#4-%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C-%EC%A0%9C%EC%96%B4---stagger\" aria-label=\"4 다중 요소 제어   stagger permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>stagger 기능을 사용하면 각 개체의 애니메이션의 시작 사이에 약간의 지연시간을 넣어 보다 쉽게 제어할 수 있습니다.<br>\nstagger 객체를 사용하면 stagger가 시작되는 위치와 타이밍이 분산되는 방식을 더 잘 제어할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\".stage .box\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">y</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">50</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">stagger</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">each</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">from</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"end\"</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>each</strong>: 0.2 는 각 애니메이션의 시작 사이에 0.2초가 있음을 의미합니다.</li>\n<li><strong>amount</strong>: 0.2 는 모든 애니메이션이 0.2초 이내에 시작됩니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">from</code> 으로 받을 수 있는 값 first, end, center, edges</p>\n</blockquote>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - stagger\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/bGJqbaK?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/bGJqbaK\">\r\n  GSAP3 - stagger</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"5-tween-control\" style=\"position:relative;\">5. tween control<a href=\"#5-tween-control\" aria-label=\"5 tween control permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>Tween에는 재생을 제어하는 여러 가지 방법들이 있습니다.<br>\n트윈을 제어하려면 이를 참조할 방법이 필요합니다. 아래의 코드처럼 트윈을 참조하는 변수를 설정합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> tween <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> gsap<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\".box\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">x</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">600</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">paused</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>트윈이 자동으로 재생되지 않도록 하려면 paused 속성을 true로 설정하여 처음 자동재생을 막을 수 있습니다.<br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">tween.pause()</code> 로도 가능합니다.</p>\n<p>해당 트윈을 재생하려면 나중에 다음을 호출할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">tween<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">play</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\ntween<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">pause</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\ntween<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">resume</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\ntween<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">reverse</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\ntween<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">restart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - Tween Control\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/oNOZvqY?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/oNOZvqY\">\r\n  GSAP3 - Tween Control</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<h3 id=\"6-트윈의-버그-해결방법\" style=\"position:relative;\">6. 트윈의 버그, 해결방법<a href=\"#6-%ED%8A%B8%EC%9C%88%EC%9D%98-%EB%B2%84%EA%B7%B8-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"6 트윈의 버그 해결방법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>지금까지 GSAP의 기본 트윈으로 할 수 있는 많은 애니메이션들을 만들어봤습니다.<br>\nGSAP을 사용하면 몇 줄의 코드로 다양하고 많은 애니메이션들을 만들어낼 수 있습니다.<br>\n하지만, 몇가지 의도치 않은 문제점들도 발생합니다.</p>\n<p>에러의 원인을 확인하기 위해 gsap의 <code class=\"language-text\">getProperty</code> 메서드를 이용해 확인해봅시다.</p>\n<iframe height=\"300\" style=\"width: 100%;\" scrolling=\"no\" title=\"GSAP3 - from() Tweens Glitch\" src=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/embed/abxJoKd?default-tab=html%2Cresult\" frameborder=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" allowtransparency=\"true\">\r\n      See the Pen <a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok/pen/abxJoKd\">\r\n  GSAP3 - from() Tweens Glitch</a> by Miok Song (miok) (<a href=\"https://codepen.io/Miok-Song-miok\">@Miok-Song-miok</a>)\r\n  on <a href=\"https://codepen.io\">CodePen</a>.\r\n</iframe>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">gsap.fromTo()</code> 메서드로 처음 시작점과 끝 점을 정확하게 지정해주면 해결됩니다.</p>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h4 id=\"참고\" style=\"position:relative;\">참고<a href=\"#%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\"참고 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Homepage | GSAP</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://productive-printer-b81.notion.site/GSAP-Basic-4c37387fe8254db4a7d14c883f8baa2d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GSAP Basic | Notion</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#tween\">tween</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#1-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95---to-from-fromto\">1. 기본 문법 - to, from, fromTo</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#gsapto\">gsap.to()</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#gsapfrom\">gsap.from()</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#gsapfromto\">gsap.fromTo()</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#1-1-short-codes-properties\">1-1. Short codes properties</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#2-%EC%A7%80%EC%97%B0%EA%B3%BC-%EB%B0%98%EB%B3%B5---delay-repeat-yoyo-repeatdelay\">2. 지연과 반복 - delay, repeat, yoyo, repeatDelay</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#3-%EA%B0%80%EC%86%8D%EB%8F%84---easing\">3. 가속도 - easing</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#4-%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C-%EC%A0%9C%EC%96%B4---stagger\">4. 다중 요소 제어 - stagger</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#5-tween-control\">5. tween control</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#6-%ED%8A%B8%EC%9C%88%EC%9D%98-%EB%B2%84%EA%B7%B8-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\">6. 트윈의 버그, 해결방법</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\">참고</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 6, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"tween, stagger, timeline","summary":"tween Tweens는 모든 애니메이션이 작동하는 역할을 말하며, ( high-performance property setter ) 대상 ( 애니메이션을 적용할 객체) 에게 duration, animation-properties 정보를 입력하는 하나의 단위로 해석합니다. Tween은 3가지의 methods를 가지고","date":"Mar 20, 2024","categories":["GSAP"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/tween_stagger_timeline/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/custom-plugin/","title":"Custom Plugin"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/gsap/timeline/","title":"timeline"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}